				96,
				2
			],
			"Message": "build: Update submodule dependencies\n\nUpdate Dependency and Element submodules to their latest upstream commits:\n- Dependency: 4037490\n- Element: 7d1394b\n\nThese updates incorporate recent upstream improvements and bug fixes from the respective dependencies. Submodule version bumps help maintain compatibility and ensure access to the latest security patches and performance enhancements in dependent components.",
			"SHA": "878e5caf28d173ca3d92b4c3c1048315cd062b54"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-05-01T00:42:13Z",
			"File": [
				"⡇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				96,
				10
			],
			"Message": "chore: Add Tauri dependencies and update submodules\n\n- Added Tauri framework dependencies to Cargo.toml including core Tauri crate\n- Updated Dependency submodule to commit 535caf2 (Tauri-related components)\n- Updated Element submodule to commit 7be3cc8 (likely supporting Tauri integration)\n- Added TAURI_DEV_CUSTOM_ROOT_CA_PATH environment variable to turbo.json configuration\n\nThese changes prepare the project for Tauri integration by establishing required dependencies and development environment configuration. The submodule updates suggest corresponding updates in related components to support desktop application capabilities through Tauri's framework.",
			"SHA": "20ab91670aa1d420ec22e7f20256b6462ceab4d0"
		},
